window.products.push({"id":544161,"name":"10 inch Stainless Steel Muddler for Cocktails and Mixing Spoon with Cocktail Recipes Book - Professional Home Bar Cocktail Muddler Set for Creating Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gnp9Eq6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Muddler Set For Your Bar - This 10\" bar muddler is one of the most important tools to unleash amazing flavors in any drink made. It is essential to have this cocktail muddler to make your desired drink on any day of the week. Premium Quality Stainless Steel - This drink muddler is made of a stainless steel body and a grooved nylon head made to withstand any drink, while also ensuring ease and comfort the whole time. This sleek drink smasher/ muddler set is designed to crush or smash any fruit, herb, or spice without damaging your glassware to make any drink you have in mind. Essential For Any Delicious Drink - There are two things that are essential for a flavorful drink, alcohol and a muddling set. A stainless steel muddler tool allows for you to crush any fruit, mint, or spice in a bowl to make the best drinks exploding with flavor. With this muddler set make your favorite mojitos, an old fashioned, or even a mint julep. The drink options are endless with this cocktail muddler set. Twisted Stirrer And Trident Fork Included - This muddler set does not require any additional bar tools. This muddler for cocktails also includes a comfortable and durable stirrer on one end and a fork on the other allowing you to add final touches to your drinks like delicious garnishes or layering. Enjoy this all inclusive set made to be any type of muddler you want: Mojito muddler, fruit muddler, and of course a cocktail muddler! Low Maintenance Guaranteed - This cocktail muddler is designed with stainless steel that guarantees easy clean up. After each use simply put your muddler set in your dishwasher and watch how easy it cleans without warping, rusting, or discoloration. With this muddler set only having two pieces, it also allows it to be easily stored whenever and wherever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gnp9Eq6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRESIMO","source_asin":"B01IEPTEBI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IEPTEBI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IEPTEBI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
