window.products.push({"id":544249,"name":"Hamilton Beach (HBB908) 44 oz Commercial Two-Speed Blender - 908 Series","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":178.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414iRGncUNL.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve customers quickly and efficiently with Hamilton Beach Commercial 908 Bar Blender. Blend 16 ounce margaritas and other bar drinks in less than 30 seconds. Our most affordable bar blender with the versatility of 2 speeds. Four stainless steel blades quickly cut through ice and other ingredients. The 44 ounce container is made from break-resistant polycarbonate. It has a removable filler cap to allow the operator to add ingredients while blending. The easy-to-read measurement marks allow for efficient drink preparation. Sure Grip feet ensure the blender stays securely on the counter. Durable clutch has a rubber and metal construction. Rubber dampens noise while metal reinforcement increases durability. Amazon.com A great choice for the busy bartender, this Hamilton Beach commercial blender offers durability, power, and no-frills function at its best. The base features a 3/8-horsepower motor with thankfully simple operation and two metal toggles--one to set the machine to high or low, and one to turn it on and off. The blenders cutting assembly features a rugged metal base, a four-angle stainless steel blade, and a replaceable heavy-duty neoprene clutch to extend the life of the motor. Made from durable polypropylene plastic, the container holds 44 ounces (1-1/4 liters), is clearly marked in cups and liters, and rests stably on the countertop. Its flexible cover fits securely and includes a removable clear 2-ounce filler cap. Though not intended to crush ice, the unit easily blends smaller ice cubes with liquid ingredients. It is suitable for hot or cold drinks, crushed ice cocktails, smoothies, and soups. Assembled, it stands 6-1/2 by 15 by 6-1/2 inches. Hamilton Beach recommends washing the container by hand and includes a two-year warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414iRGncUNL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach Commercial","source_asin":"B000TLX868","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TLX868","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TLX868","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
