window.products.push({"id":544253,"name":"Happybuy Meat Grinder 1.14 HP 850 W Electric, 12 Diameter with Stainless Steel Blade Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61izzqVV9oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 850w meat grinder which can produce 264.5 lbs. of meat per hour, and it's made of high quality stainless steel. With enough power for tough meats and wild game. Easy to use, take apart and clean. The aluminum finish is very nice, wipes easily and is very durable. Though we tend to use an electric grinder mostly for meats, poultry and wild game, and use a food processor for vegetables, it is capable of handling these for those who prefer it. Owing to the tech which cool the overheated motors, our machine have more longer use life and durable too. The meat grinder comes with 2 cutting plates and 2 cutting blades. The meat grinder stainless steel construction is easy to clean and is durable enough for commercial use the meat grinder mincer easy to assemble and disassemble, very simple to operate, low noise and energy efficient. Powerful 1.14 HP motor lets this meat grinder automatically grind most popular meats the meat grinder has a stable base and 4 plastic nozzles to ensure a better stability. For this meat grinder sturdy full stainless steel & aluminum body lets it stand up to the rigors of every-day use perfect for restaurants, school cafeterias, butcher shops, hotels, supermarket or any other food service industries. Technical parameter material :Stainless steel & aluminum. Efficiency: 270 lbs. per hour. Speed : 190 r/min. Cutting plate diameter: 2-3/4\". Hole in fine cutting plate diameter: 1/4\". Holes in coarse cutting plate diameter: 5/16''. Feeding table: 12-3/4\" x 8-1/4\" x 1-3/4\" with 2-3/4\" feed hole. Package content 1x electric meat grinder 1x stainless steel feeding table 2x stainless steel cutting plates 2x stainless steel cutting blades 1x food pusher 1x grinding board with 8mm hole size 1x grinding knife 1x user manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61izzqVV9oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happybuy","source_asin":"B01LXL9L7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXL9L7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXL9L7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
