window.products.push({"id":544331,"name":"Tree Ring Coasters - Black Locust Mixed Set of Six","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B3bnyiSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each set of Tree Ring Coasters includes six all natural Black Locust Coasters of various sizes with diameters ranging from under four inches to over five inches. Black Locust is an incredibly beautiful, natural hard wood found in the Blue Ridge Mountains. It is well known as a very very dense and hard wood and is also quite impervious to water. You will marvel at the tree rings and innate beauty in each and every coaster. They will be an instant conversation piece around the house. These are beautiful coasters, hand made, each like no other, packed with character. Due to the wood density, these coasters may not soak up a lot of water, so if you need to have a coaster that soaks up a lot of water from a sweaty glass, these are not for you. What makes these beautiful is that nature made them. The \"narlier\", the better. This also means that we have very limited control over their size and shape. That makes them even better. We kiln dry these to ensure they are consistently dry and this also sanitizes them. Hand processed, but nature made....You will enjoy these coasters for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B3bnyiSnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tree Ring Products","source_asin":"B00IVQCHO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IVQCHO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IVQCHO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
