window.products.push({"id":544393,"name":"DalNim Extra-Large 18-inch – Premium Moon Shelf – Black Shelves for Wall Decor – Wooden Display Shelves with 2 Secure Hooks – Healing Crystal and Ston","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GrpnxU45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Gift for friends and family: A beautiful, modern, 18-inch Moon Shelf that is made out of the highest quality materials and is built to last. It's sure to be a talked about topic of conversation among friends and family members. Extra-Large Design: Unlike other products on the market, our moon floating shelf comes in an extra-large 18-inch size that provides plenty of storage space. You can use it for storing plants, statues, crystals, figures, essential oils, and many other accessories by making use of different-shaped compartments. High Qualty: This premium moon shelf is a decorative piece will add to the room's ambiance. The premium wood used to craft this product are carefully selected and crafted, giving it an elegant look that only gets better with age. High quality black moon shelf with perfect finish on the edges. The small details make all the difference in this black wooden shelf. The clean and simple design is easy to match with any color scheme. Stylish Design: Our moon shaped shelf has a stunning look that adds a touch of style and luxury in your home. With a simple all-black design, this accessory is suitable for virtually any room of the house, from the living room to the nursery, meditation room, and even bathroom. Durable and Reliable: Our moon shelf for crystals is made entirely out of wood, a durable and long-lasting material that will not disappoint. The moon floating design provides plenty of storage space, featuring sturdy built-in shelves for a wide range of accessories. Stable and Secure: We wanted to make sure that our moon phase wall hanging shelf is a reliable accessory that provides a safe environment for yourself and your family. That is why we have integrated 2 different hooks that make the design more stable, allowing you to add objects on a single side of the shelf without damaging it. Planet-Friendly: This crescent moon shelf is made of sustainable materials that are 100% planet-friendly, as well as sturdy and long-lasting. You get to enjoy excellent finishing touches and excellent quality without compromising on the state of the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GrpnxU45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DalNim","source_asin":"B09QHHYSBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QHHYSBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QHHYSBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544394,"name":"Portfolio Canvas Decor 30 by 40-Inch Printed Wall Art Painting, Large, Happy Splash IV by L. Carson","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SC1Wv+fXL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","description":"Product Description Portfolio Canvas Decor's framed canvas art collection is constructed from the highest quality wood stretcher bars and canvas, printed with first-class giclee printing machines and is fully manufactured in the United States. With gallery wrapped edges measuring 1 1/2 Inch and the print continuing on the sides, this panel piece is sure to elicit design, style and fashion from any angle. The \"Happy Splash IV\" print is a beautiful floral rendering including a purple and yellow flower blooming with green stem and petals. This print is the perfect addition to any home decor project, providing gallery quality wall art sure to complete any room. Canvas print comes stretched, framed and ready to hang. From the Manufacturer Portfolio Canvas Decor is America's oldest and leading publisher of fine art prints, paintings, and designs, and Portfolio Canvas Decor's beautiful assortment of images on canvas allows the entire and ever-growing collection to be purchased at fabulous pricing. Our collection consist of thousands of images from hundreds of artists, comprising the widest array of designs, patterns and styles on canvas available. Portfolio Canvas Decor is confident that their canvas artwork will complete any room, making the perfect finishing touch to any decor project. Our online offering consists of 1500+ items in styles including abstract, coastal, sea, shore, floral, landscapes, cityscapes, horses, animals, lake, lodge, rustic, vintage, culinary, birds, contemporary, modern, classic, transitional, vintage, geometric, architecture, and more. Constructed with solid pine stretcher bars with reinforced corners, you will find our product to be sturdy and strong with a high quality giclee print.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SC1Wv+fXL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portfolio Canvas Decor","source_asin":"B017U6MVH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017U6MVH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017U6MVH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544395,"name":"Indian Selections White Silver Tab Top Sheer Sari Curtain/Drape/Panel - 80W x 96L - Pair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GhiLD0TvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Add splendor to any room in your home with these Tab Top sari sheer curtains from India. These handmade drapes are heavily bordered with excellent artworkSari Curtains / Drapes / Panels are the perfect choice for those looking for light, elegant drapes with a touch of luxury. It has smooth finish with a soft sheen and feels gentle and cool to the touch. Sheer curtains made of saris allow light in through windows but prevent people looking in when they are drawn. Story Behind the Art: The fabric of these curtains are weaved on a hand-loom in a small rural village in India and then hand-dyed. The artisans are a group of young hand-crafters who have moved from small villages to a big town in Central India and make various home decor items out of these exotic sari fabrics. This gives these wonderful artisans a way to have sustainable income via selling to the worldwide market on the internet. Your purchase supports local and home-based work where the artisans can easily tend to their families and pass these time-honored skills from one generation to the next.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GhiLD0TvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indian Selections","source_asin":"B07BWBPTJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BWBPTJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BWBPTJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
