window.products.push({"id":544470,"name":"TENRAI Delicates Laundry Bags, Bra Fine Mesh Wash Bag for Underwear, Lingerie, Bra, Pantyhose, Socks, Use YKK Zipper, Have Hanger Loops, Large Opening","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7158NT7xFPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The TENRAI delicates laundry bag guarantee protection for your delicates, lingerie, bra, underwear, stocking, hosiery, sweater and baby clothes. These delicates wash bags help avoid stretching straps, snags and damaging other clothing with loose bra hooks. The zipper on the laundry wash bag is Aluminium alloy. Therefore it is rustless, and there is a zipper holder on the bag which will prevent the wash bags from opening up during washing.  Simply make your delicates in the bags, and zip it closed. Now you are ready to wash your garments with premium protection.  - LIFETIME GUARANTEE If you are not satisfied with the performance of your laundry bags, send them back for a full refund. No questions asked.  - GET 1 SET FOR YOURSELF AND GIVE THE GIFT OF LAUNDRY PERFECTION TO A FRIEND OR COLLEAGE KIDS. - CLICK THAT YELLOW \"ADD TO CART\" BUTTON AT THE TOP OF THE PAGE TO PROTECT YOUR DELICATES AND EXPENSIVE GARMENTS RIGHT NOW! YOU WILL LIKE THAT YOU DID.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7158NT7xFPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TENRAI","source_asin":"B07C7RG1KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C7RG1KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C7RG1KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544471,"name":"Rowenta DR5020 Ultra Steam 800-Watt Handheld Steamer Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31g4tAEDvcL._AC_.jpg","description":"It's all about the Steam\". New from Rowenta, the DR5020 Pro Steam Hand-Held Steam Brush is easy to use. Designed by Faltazi, specialists of Rowenta products, the DR5020 Pro Steam Hand- Held Steam Brush has a powerful 800 watts; comes with dual voltage 120w/240w and provides a powerful, continuous steam output. An electric pump for steam on demand and variable steam dial, the removable water tank holds 1.7oz of water. The wide steam head distributes steam quickly for great results. The DR5020 Pro Steam Hand-Held Steam Brush comes with a removable fabric brush plus a removable lint pad. Well balanced with an ergonomic design, it has a hanging hook for easy storage and comes with a travel pouch for easy carrying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31g4tAEDvcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rowenta","source_asin":"B000SXF8NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000SXF8NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000SXF8NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544472,"name":"SAVERHO Over The Door Shoe Organizer, Hanging Shoe Organizer with 24 Mesh Large Pockets Door Shoe Rack Organizer for Men Women Kids Hanging Shoe Stora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wcjIrvrqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✌【BREATHABLE ECO-FRIENDLY MATERIAL】This door shoe organizer is made of thicker non-woven fabric with nylon mesh pocket which is breathable , eco-friendly. Especially wet shoes, don't worry about getting gross and mildewed,mesh pockets design can promote the air air circulation and dry quickly. the net fabric is see-through makes you to find each pair quickly. ✌【SUITABLE FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY】There are 3 sizes of the pockets hanging shoe organizer for your whole family. The top two layers are suitable for small size children's shoes, the middle two layers are for women's shoes, and the bottom two layers are fit for men's sport shoes, It can meet different sizes of shoes for the whole family. ✌【SPACE-SAVING AND EASY TO HANGING】 The door shoe rack organizer is perfect to storage your shoes.In addition to this, the door shoe holder is great for you to store socks, gloves, scarves and even toys, keys, kitchen supplies, toiletry items, cleaning supplies. You can hang it anywhere you want. ✌【APPLICATION IN ANYWHERE AND CONVENIENCE】Door hanging shoe organizers for closet door, pantry room, bathroom, living-room, cruise, RV even the classroom.The shoe holder organizer can be folded into a small size,it’s very convenient to take it out for travelling. ✌【ADJUSTABLE HOOKS FOR DIFFERENT THICKNESS DOOR】 Some hooks are either too thick that may damaged your door, or too thin that is not sturdy to hold weight and will bend. our hooks are just right thickness and sturdy to hold the door shoe rack. Considering the different thickness of doors, we upgrade the hooks to be adjustable, it fit for the doors withing thickness 1.37 to1.97inch. so you needn’t worry about the door either too thick or too thin for the shoe rack organizer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wcjIrvrqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAVERHO","source_asin":"B08P6QFDTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P6QFDTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P6QFDTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
