window.products.push({"id":544515,"name":"Broad Rimmed Straw Hat with Adjustable Chin Tie (Hat with Center Crease)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7120Ys5V2qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These hats are made of the highest quality Pachone Straw (from palm leaves); don't confuse these with hats from China, these are made in North America! When straw hats are woven by hand, they are sorted by grade, depending how tight the hats weave. These hats are made only from the top grade of hand-woven straws. Skin cancer is the most common form of cancer in the United States. Doctors recommend wearing sunscreen AND a hat for maximum sun protection. 100% straw. Elastic band. Ventilation rivets. Size: one size elastic stretch for comfort. Adjustable chin tie. Natural color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7120Ys5V2qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gold Coast","source_asin":"B00U2XHBKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U2XHBKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U2XHBKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544516,"name":"Ebros Gift Rustic Bronze Finish Nautilus Steampunk Pipes Valves And Gears Coffee Tea Mug Beer Stein Tankard Drink Cup 18oz Fantasy Industrial Victoria","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zbihcvUxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Needing an exotic and unique drink mug for your kitchen or drinking pleasure? This steampunk mug will meet your needs! You can see gears, pipes, valves and other steampunk mechanical components sculpted and painted on the surface of the mug. Adapted and inspired by the nautilus submarine, this mug is painted in faded rustic bronze color, giving it a previous vintage look. This Steampunk Tankard Mug is 5.25\" tall, 6\" long and 4.25\" in diameter. Mug has 18oz capacity. Handwash only and keep soap off of the painted surface. Soap should be applied only to the stainless steel portion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zbihcvUxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ebros Gift","source_asin":"B082ZBMM2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082ZBMM2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082ZBMM2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544517,"name":"Welcome Home IV Artwork by Daphne Brissonnet, 35 by 35-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gcQeLBz+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a bird, a butterfly, a teal birdhouse, orange flowers and the word \"nest\" against a tan and teal background. Daphne Brissonnet has always been drawn to the beauty of nature. Her early studies in botany opened her eyes to the form, dimension and subtle colors of her natural subjects. As she discovered a universe of unexpected beauty in the flowers and plants she studied, painting these subjects became an important part of her life, while revealing her talents as an artist. Primarily self-taught, Daphne continues to refine her skills by attending workshops in France and the U.S. as well as closer to her home in Canada. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gcQeLBz+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00NEJZE4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NEJZE4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NEJZE4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
