window.products.push({"id":544582,"name":"HUGE XXL JUMBO FIST SIZE OBSIDIAN SNOWFLAKE Tumbled Therapy Palm Stone Crystal Healing Mineral Gemstone & Pouch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RLT2ZYcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You'll receive one huge Obsidian Snowflake XXL jumbo tumbled therapy stone. Some call it a palm stone or even a fist stone because it's nearly as big as a small fist. It's approximately 3 inches long (75mm) and can weigh anywhere from 9 ounces to just under 1 pound. The one shown is an example only. You'll get one similar as each stone is unique and have natural variations. Your purchase will include a large black velveteen drawstring storage pouch as shown. Also, as a bonus, we'll include a Stone Properties Information Card for this specific variety of stone and a handy Stone Identification Chart. It shows the names and pictures of 50 common stones. It's printed on a heavy card stock and makes a nice addition or tool in assisting you with whatever kind of stone collection you might have.   Properties of Obsidian Snowflake. A stone of purity, serenity and clarity. It helps balance our mind, body and spirit. It recognizes and releases wrong thinking and ingrained patterns. It brings things to the surface. They can be positive or negative, love, anger, secrets; but they surface more gently then they might otherwise. Snowflake provides balance during times of change. It aids in seeing patterns in life and recreating them in a more beneficial way. It can shield against negativity and give protection from physical and emotional harm. It is associated with the root chakra and is beneficial for the veins, skeleton, and obtaining smooth skin. It relieves muscle cramps and is a detoxification stone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RLT2ZYcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Water Crystals","source_asin":"B00GQ5AXEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GQ5AXEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GQ5AXEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
