window.products.push({"id":544695,"name":"VivaTerra Recycled Round Glass Balloon Vase | 13\" H x 14\" Dia. | Handblown Colorful Glass Vases for Home Decor Mantels and Tabletop | Unique Table Cen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yVkhRjozL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of artful appeal to your space with this 13\" Tall Recycled Glass Balloon Vase. Handcrafted in Spain from smooth recycled glass for a striking look, this unique glass vase is a great way to display your decorative blooms, and it also works as a stunning standalone piece. The compelling bubble shape complements any existing decor, and it's easy to use in a variety of rooms. Place it anywhere from your kitchen table to your mantel for a simple, charming accent you and your guests will love. The 13-inch tall vase features an over all stout, organic shape and a lipped opening, perfect for displaying a few small blossoms. Available in a variety of color options, show off a single vase in your favorite color or mix and match the bubble vase with other shapes in our collection to create a show-stopping centerpiece. Made in Spain. Why we use recycled glass? Recycling glass saves energy! Making new glass means heating sand and other substances to 2,600 degrees. That requires a lot of energy and creates a lot of industrial pollution. One of the steps in glass recycling is to crush the glass and create a product called \"cullet.\" Making recycled glass products from cullet consumes 40% less energy than making new glass from raw materials, because cullet melts at a much lower temperature. It also allows post-consumer products to have a new life instead of ending up in landfills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yVkhRjozL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivaterra","source_asin":"B0BV7GT3HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV7GT3HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV7GT3HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544696,"name":"The Royal Gift Shop: Teal Genuine Brazilian Extra Quality Agate Bookends - Home Decor (Teal, 6-9 lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I9zyDdRoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAZILIAN AGATE GEODES are sliced and polished to create natural bookends that show off the beauty of both the rough and polished stone. These bookends have two polished sides for each piece and a smooth cut base. Agate is excellent for balancing emotional and physical energy. Historically, it has been used in healing amulets and ornamentation dating back to Babylon. 'Agate' is the name given to numerous varieties of banded Chalcedony, a mineral of the quartz family. Usually banded in layers or stripes, some varieties have specks of color or fossilized inclusions, while others are solid. Dubbed a 'earth rainbow', the concentric bands of Agate form in nearly every color the earth can produce, including a colorless shade. SOME WIDELY ACCLAIMED BENEFITS OF AGATE: Promotes inner stability, composure, and maturity  Its warm, protective properties encourage security and self-confidence It is a great crystal to use during pregnancy, and also helps new mothers avoid the 'baby Blues' sometimes experienced after giving birth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I9zyDdRoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Royal Gift Shop","source_asin":"B01CUOCHY0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CUOCHY0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CUOCHY0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
