window.products.push({"id":544721,"name":"Senjoo Blackout Curtains 52 x 84 Inches Long for Bedroom, Soundproof Window Curtains Drapes 2 Panel Sets, Thermal Grommet Curtains Room Darkening Insu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kCC6m6eaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❥【MADE OF PREMIUM SOFT SILKY MATERIAL】: Senjoo blackout curtains are made of 100% Polycotton fabric, Very breathable and comfortable. Each curtains for bedroom set comes in 2 panels, each panel measures 52 inch width by 84 inch length. The curtains & drapes panels feature 8 silver grommets of 1.6 inch inner diameter coordinate with most window curtains rods. We recommend the total width of black out curtains panels being 1.5-2 times the curtain rod length. ❥【WE DID ALL LIGHT BLOCKING ALMOST】Senjoo curtains 84 inches long effectively block 95% of the sun's rays and UV rays, thanks to the three-layer weave technology inside. Protects your sun-exposed furniture and floors. Privacy protection. The biggest benefit is that it brings you a good night's sleep and keeps you energized every day. ❥【VERSATILE REDUCE NOISE&INSULATED CURTAINS】Blackout curtains for bedroom reduce noise, are suitable for late sleepers and nappers (darker colours work better) and help improve energy efficiency by blocking light and insulating against the cold while helping you save money on your home's heating and cooling bills. ❥【THE BEST CHIOCE FOR HOME DÉCOR】These drapes are sure to make your home décor sparkle immediately. Our black out cute curtains are suitable for decoration in various styles such as Bohemia, farmhouses, Western style, and rustic vintage curtains. Moderate blackout curtains 84 inch length 2 panels set does a great job at blocking out light and is perfect for living rooms, bedrooms, laundry rooms, dining rooms, kitchens, bathrooms, children's rooms, French doors, sliding doors and doorways. ❥【EASY CARE WINDOW TREATMENTS】 Our soundproof curtains are made to last and easy to maintain. These 84 inches long room darkening curtains are durable thanks to the fine material and good workmanship. The thermal curtains are machine washable and drying when needed. Creases on eclipse blackout curtains panels due to packing and shipping can be pressed by ironing or steaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kCC6m6eaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senjoo","source_asin":"B0BGGKKNQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGGKKNQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGGKKNQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544722,"name":"Better Livin 10 Pc Glazed Ceramic Ramen Bowl Set (60oz) with 2 Bowls, 2 Spoons, 2 Chopsticks, 2 Holders, 2 Japanese Tea Cups for Ramen Noodles, Soup, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PqXLjednS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"10-PIECE SET WITH TEACUPS & CHOPSTICKS: Why splurge on expensive restaurants when you can have the fine dining experience right at home? With a set of two noodle bowls, soup spoons, real wooden chopsticks, spoon stands and Japanese teacups, you’ll have everything you need for the perfect Asian meal (or your favorite cereal if you’re having a lazy day!). LARGE 60 OZ. BOWL CAPACITY: Fill your bowl to the brim with all the toppings you can handle, with 60 oz. of soup space (20 oz. MORE than other bowls!). Slurp ramen, udon or pho from beautiful traditional bowls or skip the noodles and go for egg drop soup instead. Add soft-boiled eggs, perfectly braised pork and heaps of noodles for a bit of umami in every bite! CUSTOM SOUP SPOONS WITH HOOK: Never watch your spoon drown again with a custom hook design that keeps cutlery casualties to a minimum. The 6” spoon attaches perfectly to the rim of your bowl, so when you’re not drinking deliciously rich broth, it won’t sink in a sea of noodles. Plus, our ramen spoon is made of sturdy ceramic for better gripping and sipping! And an added benefit is the anti-skid base of the spoons which allows them to perfectly sit on the spoon and stand without slippage. PREMIUM FOOD-GRADE CERAMIC: Gloss, glaze and glamour -- that’s the ramen bowl charm! Our beautiful ceramic bowls, spoons and cups feature Under Glaze technology for food-safe suppers in traditional Asian style. Enjoy all of your favorite noodle soups, rice dishes and pasta in the gorgeous bowl and sip steamy green tea from the cups! DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE & FREEZER SAFE: Who knew one little bowl could do so much? Our extra large Japanese bowls aren’t just great for heaping servings of your favorite foods -- they’re microwave, freezer and dishwasher-safe, too! Freeze leftovers, nuke ‘em in the microwave and toss in the dishwasher after a belly-busting meal for super easy cleanup!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PqXLjednS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Livin","source_asin":"B08C92RPDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C92RPDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C92RPDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544723,"name":"2 Inch Twin Size Accu-Gel Infused Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper Made in the USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":196.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pFsy57KML._AC_.jpg","description":"Accu-Gel has been developed as the unique, new state of the art cooling gel visco elastic memory foam. Accu-Gel is manufactured and engineered to be the leading GEL premium grade visco elastic memory foam and our new proprietary formulation makes Accu-Gel more durable. The new Accu-Gel visco elastic memory foam features a distinctive open cell gel formulation that makes it amazingly soft to the touch and more sensitive to your body, completely eliminating areas of tension and adding buoyancy. Accu-Gel visco elastic memory foam will envelop your body in a luxurious, gravity free comfort zone that will result in a great restorative and rejuvenating sleep day after day and night after night for many years. The increased comfort you experience will allow you to arise, refreshed and ready to take on the day. That is because the extended durability of Accu-Gel allows it to resist painful pressure points better than conventional visco elastic memory foams. The result is enhanced, longer lasting comfort that fully satisfies your customers for many years. All our Memory Foam Mattress Toppers are made using Memory Foam produced in the USA, they are manufactured in our own factories, and are competitively priced while not compromising on quality. We do not import any of our memory foam products as we believe that US guidelines have an impact on quality and longevity. A visco elastic memory mattress topper from Accutex Foam USA could be the answer to your sleep problems. Many of our customers report dramatic improvements in their sleep patterns as a result of using our marvelous memory foam mattress toppers from Accutex Foam USA and we have a selection that will fit your individualized needs. Whether you need a visco elastic memory mattress topper for your bed, a guest bed or your child’s bed we have the size and comfort level to suit your needs. Memory mattress toppers are extremely easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pFsy57KML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accutex Foam USA","source_asin":"B00IY440PU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IY440PU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IY440PU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
