window.products.push({"id":544886,"name":"Hisar Mercury Turkish teapot, Medium, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C02DfKZQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Turkish Tea: The method normally used to brew Turkish tea is different from the most common way worldwide. In the traditional way, Turkish tea is made by using a double-decked teapot. The lower pot is usually bigger and is used for boiling water. Tea leaves are put into the upper teapot, and when water is ready, it is poured from the lower pot into the upper one to start the brewing process. Some hot water remains in the lower pot. This preparation method allows the tea to be served in different strengths to satisfy different palates. Both pots are used while serving Turkish tea. First, the brewed tea is poured from the smaller teapot into the tulip-shaped tea glasses. Then it is diluted with water from the bigger pot. If someone prefers darker tea then their brew is mixed with less water. This can be adjusted by watching the colour of the mixture which varies from pink to dark, almost black tea.Hisar produces high-quality stainless steel kitchenware, utensils and tableware for more than 50 years. Hisar factory operates according to the internationally respected ISO 9001 standard. To ensure long-life and durability, all Hisar products are made of 18/10 (304 grade) Cr/Ni Stainless Steel. Hisar Tealove was developed to the highest standards in the industry. Its 0.80mm thick body is polished to give a fantastic mirror-finish. Its handles provide safe and comfortable handling. Tealove’s beautiful design will improve your kitchen’s looks and be a part of your unforgettable moments with family and friends. With Hisar Tealove you can enjoy delicious Turkish/Persian tea as well as all your other favorite teas, including herbal tea. Hisar Tealove can be used on all stoves, including induction. It can be easily washed by hand or dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C02DfKZQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hisar","source_asin":"B07D3Z5BGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3Z5BGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3Z5BGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
