window.products.push({"id":544900,"name":"Kate and Laurel Hylton Modern Farmhouse 3-Tier Floating Wall Shelf for Display and Storage, 18x28x7, Rustic Brown/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CaXZ+OmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A wall shelf is no longer only for storage! Now your space-saving storage solutions can be a charming and show-stopping wall display. That's what makes the Hylton wall shelf so perfect! It features three tiers of lovely and resilient wooden shelves within a sturdy metal frame, creating a jaw-dropping display and storage solution for all your favorite keepsakes and household necessities. Its beautiful mixed materials finish makes for a bold impression in any room of the home. The Hylton shelf is 18 inches wide by 6.5 inches deep with a height of 27.75 inches, making it the perfect addition to any living room, bedroom, bathroom, entryway, or dining room. Each shelf is 17.25 inches wide by 6 inches deep, with 8.5 inches of space separating each shelf for keepsakes, photos, bathroom necessities, plants, and other household items. Hang this beautiful mixed materials wall shelf in only a matter of seconds with the convenient metal eyelet hangers securely attached to the back of the metal frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CaXZ+OmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B0BT9KVJLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT9KVJLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT9KVJLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":544901,"name":"Vacplus Moisture Absorbers Dehumidifier Bucket -Unscented Dehumidifiers for Closet, Highly Absorbent Dehumidifier Bucket for basements, bathrooms, boa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HeeCj7FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFICIENT DEHUMIDIFICATION: The lid of Vacplus dehumidifiers for home adopts a mesh design, which greatly improves the ventilation. Moreover, the 4.3'' x 3.9'' moisture absorber bucket uses a large calcium chloride tablet to enlarge the absorbing area and absorb excess moisture. Simply keep your room dry for a long time with Vacplus. VISIBLE EFFECT: The support frame inside the moisture remover buckets can separate the collected moisture from the calcium chloride tablet, helping to improve the dehumidifying efficacy of the product. You will know how it effectively works just by observing the increasing water in the moisture collecting layer day by day. EASY OPERATION: These safe moisture absorbers are easy to use with just 3 steps. First, reverse the support frame in the moisture absorber bucket. Then, remove the plastic wrapper of the tablet and put it into the bucket. Lastly, cap the bucket lid tight and it is all set. Just let these moisture bags dehumidify anywhere you want. UNRESTRICTED PLACEMENT: No artificial essence added, Vacplus humidity absorbers buckets can still prevent musty odors by absorbing excess moisture. They are ideal for enclosed areas, such as closets, bathrooms, kitchens, laundry rooms, RVs, boats, and basements. Vacplus moisture absorbers always work satisfactorily wherever it is placed. ECONOMICALLY REUSABLE: Compared with those single-used products, reusable Vacplus moisture bags with physical dehumidification produce less waste during the use. When the tablet disappears, please replace the absorber bag with a new pack. Vacplus will always advocate a cost-effective and energy-effective lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HeeCj7FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacplus","source_asin":"B0BW7L4FY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW7L4FY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW7L4FY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
