window.products.push({"id":544984,"name":"POLIVIAR Electric Gooseneck Kettle, 1200W Electric Tea Kettle Real Wood Handle, 34oz Pour Over Electric Kettle for Coffee & Tea, 18/8 Stainless Steel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPJMtpw2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEEP WHEN ITS DONE: Stop wasting your time waiting near the stove. MODE 1: Press \"Boil\" button of the gooseneck kettle. Beeps one time when it is fully boil and it will natural cooling after boil. MODE 2: Press \"Keep Warm\" button of the coffee kettle, set your temperature on \"±\" button and water will boiled to the setting temp. The temperature keeps temp for two hours before automatically turn off. Long press \"±\" button continuously for fast temperature setting. LEAK-PROOF DESIGN: POLIVIAR electric teapot unique industrial design keeps your kettle leak-proof for daily use. Easy to fill and pour over. No worry for your every-morning coffee no matter how time flies. Gooseneck spout keeps your water flow nice and steady which makes the perfect coffee and tea. Tea kettles precise water pouring makes it easier to brew coffee like a profectional barista. POLIVIAR can help you with your coffee and be your partner of life. NO RUST FOR DAILY USE: 1200 watts electric power boils full kettle of water from 32℉ to 212℉ in 5-7 minutes. Stylish electric coffee kettle electroplated for longevity. Ultra food grade finish and 18/8 stainless steel craftsmanship,ensures this pour over coffee kettle is rust and corrosion resistant. Enjoy your pour over kettle for years of continuous use with no fading over time. Goose neck tea kettle surface exposed to the water and food particles is certified as food grade safe. LIGHT UP YOUR DECOR WITH NATURE WOOD DESIGN: 34oz tea kettle will brighten your home, office and kitchen. Gooseneck electric kettle BPA free real wood handle allows you to grab the gooseneck kettle with bare hand without risking burns. Water kettle electric ergonomic shape and design maximaze your comfort to lift, pour and fill. Electric kettle temperature control. It is highly recommanded to use a set of POLIVIAR coffee press(ASIN:B0834RLLSR). WE CARE ABOUT OUR CUSTOMERS AND WE WANT TO SATISFIED EVERYONE: Please note that electric goosenect kettle voltage: 120V,60hz, which applies to US and Canada. POLIVIAR is committed to providing our consumers the absolute best price and quality on our entire line of products. All of our products qualify for a full 12 month warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPJMtpw2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POLIVIAR 7379","source_asin":"B0967M7GFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-544984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0967M7GFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0967M7GFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
